# This package ships a shebang executable and must run on macOS and Linux.
# A CRLF on the shebang line makes the kernel look for an interpreter named
# "node\r", which does not exist — the command dies with a confusing
# "env: node: No such file or directory" on every non-Windows machine.
# Committed line endings are therefore LF, always, regardless of who commits.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
